## Example usage

```python
from shinobi_rpg.core import build_mvp_world

world, player = build_mvp_world("Dan", [3, 1, 2, 4, 5])
reward = world.clear_region(player, "Verdant Gate", "move")
print(player.affinity.value, reward)
```
